on getCanonicalSiteName (adrSite, flUseCache=true) {
	«Get the canonical name for a site. Started by AR 01/12/00.
	«Changes:
		«4/9/04; 4:51:28 PM by JES
			«Optimization: Look for two additional common names for entries in config.manila.sites: one that matches the name of the site's root table, and one that matches the short name of the site, plus "Website", i.e. frontierWebsite.
			«Bug fix: When caching the site name in the page table, store it in an address value whose name ends with the site's address. Prevents a case where the adrSite parameter is ignored if any site's canonical name has been stored in the page table.
			«New optional parameter, flUseCache, determines whether the canonicalSiteName is saved in the page table. Defaults to true.
		«11/3/03; 11:31:58 AM by JES
			«Added support for static rendering.
		«12/15/00; 12:41:18 PM by PBS
			«Cache the canonical site name in the page table, for better performance.
		«01/13/00; 4:17:06 PM by PBS
			«Shortcut the process -- most times the actual name of the table matches an entry in config.manila.sites. In this common case, we can avoid the lengthy loop through config.manila.sites.
	
	«JES 5/17/03: support static rendering
	if string (adrsite) endswith ".[\"#newsSite\"].staticSite" {
		adrsite = parentOf (parentOf (adrsite^)^)};
	
	local (pta);
	if flUseCache {
		try {
			pta = html.getPageTableAddress ();
			if defined (pta^.["canonicalSiteName" + string.popFileFromAddress (adrSite)] ) { //PBS 12/15/00: cache name in page table
				return (pta^.["canonicalSiteName" + string.popFileFromAddress (adrSite)])}}};
	
	local (siteTableName = nameOf (adrSite^));
	local (shortSiteName = manilaSuite.getShortSiteName (siteTableName));
	if defined (config.manila.sites.[shortSiteName]) { //site's table is fooManilaWebsite, and entry in config.manila.sites is named foo
		if config.manila.sites.[shortSiteName] == adrSite {
			return (shortSiteName)}};
	if defined (config.manila.sites.[siteTableName]) { //next best case: site's table is fooManilaWebsite and entry in config.manila.sites is named the same
		if config.manila.sites.[siteTableName] == adrSite {
			return (siteTableName)}};
	if string.lower (siteTableName) endswith "website" {
		local (s = string.mid (siteTableName, 1, sizeOf (siteTableName) - 7));
		if defined (config.manila.sites.[s]) {
			if config.manila.sites.[s] == adrSite {
				return (s)}}};
	
	«The above were the common and best cases. If they failed, loop through config.manila.sites.
	local (adr);
	for adr in @config.manila.sites {
		try {
			if adr^ == adrSite {
				if flUseCache {
					if pta != nil {
						pta^.["canonicalSiteName" + string.popFileFromAddress (adrSite)] = nameOf (adr^)}}; //PBS 12/15/00: cache in page table
				return (nameOf (adr^))}}};
	
	scripterror ("Can't get the name of this site because there is no address in config.manila.sites pointing to this Manila site.")}